      "value": "@{5f3287055bc2dc276e0f1630|full_name}: I'm totally on board with _everything_ you are saying.\n\nYou are correct. The \"Embrace the Jank\" attitude of the past decade needs to be over.\n\nAlso, I should note, I didn't notice this was in the main Feature Requests area and not the Creator Economy area. Thus my focus on the group aspect of things.",
