  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-01-17T17:20:23.976Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A toggle between a developer version and a main/public version of your content.\n\nUpload your content to the dev branch, test it, click a button to push it to the public version if that test was successful.\n\nThis is an established standard in software development that VRChat also uses internally, so content creators should have a similar option.\n\nThe need for this is especially obvious in the new creator economy where we can't make changes to our store without them being immediately public and affecting our customers, plus the inability to test our products and listings ourselves without having them in our public store.\n\nWorld and avatar creators would also benefit from this possibility, so it should be added as a general feature for all creators to make developing and testing easier.",
